    "before": "<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">0.1 最常用 import</h4>\n<section class=\"code-card md-code-card\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><div class=\"toolbar-left\"><span class=\"window-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"file-label\">java_容器与api_深度速查手册.java</span></div><button class=\"copy-button md-copy\" type=\"button\">复制代码</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><pre class=\"md-pre\" data-lang=\"java\">import java.util.*;</pre></div></section>\n<p class=\"md-p\">大多数刷题容器、数组工具、比较器都在 <code class=\"tok-inline\">java.util</code> 里。</p>\n<p class=\"md-p\">如果后面用了 <code class=\"tok-inline\">Stream</code> / <code class=\"tok-inline\">Collectors</code>，还要额外导入：</p>\n<section class=\"code-card md-code-card\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><div class=\"toolbar-left\"><span class=\"window-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"file-label\">java_容器与api_深度速查手册.java</span></div><button class=\"copy-button md-copy\" type=\"button\">复制代码</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><pre class=\"md-pre\" data-lang=\"java\">import java.util.stream.*;</pre></div></section>\n<p class=\"md-p\">注意：<code class=\"tok-inline\">java.util.*</code> 不会自动导入 <code class=\"tok-inline\">java.util.stream.*</code> 这个子包。</p>\n<p class=\"md-p\">如果直接声明 <code class=\"tok-inline\">Predicate</code> / <code class=\"tok-inline\">Function</code> / <code class=\"tok-inline\">Consumer</code> / <code class=\"tok-inline\">Supplier</code> 这类函数式接口，还要额外导入：</p>\n<section class=\"code-card md-code-card\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><div class=\"toolbar-left\"><span class=\"window-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"file-label\">java_容器与api_深度速查手册.java</span></div><button class=\"copy-button md-copy\" type=\"button\">复制代码</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><pre class=\"md-pre\" data-lang=\"java\">import java.util.function.*;</pre></div></section>\n<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">0.2 ACM 最小代码壳</h4>\n<section class=\"code-card md-code-card\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><div class=\"toolbar-left\"><span class=\"window-dots\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><i></i><i></i><i></i></span><span class=\"file-label\">java_容器与api_深度速查手册.java</span></div><button class=\"copy-button md-copy\" type=\"button\">复制代码</button></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><pre class=\"md-pre\" data-lang=\"java\">import java.util.*;\n\npublic class Main {\n    public static void main(String[] args) {\n        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);\n\n        // read input\n        // solve\n        // print output\n    }\n}</pre></div></section>\n<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">0.3 长度、取值、添加、弹出</h4>\n<div class=\"md-table-wrap\"><table class=\"md-table\"><thead><tr><th>类型</th><th>长度</th><th>取值</th><th>添加</th><th>删除 / 弹出</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>数组</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">nums.length</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">nums[i]</code></td><td>固定长度</td><td>无</td></tr><tr><td>二维数组</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">grid.length</code> / <code class=\"tok-inline\">grid[0].length</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">grid[i][j]</code></td><td>固定长度</td><td>无</td></tr><tr><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">String</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">s.length()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">s.charAt(i)</code></td><td>不可变</td><td>不可变</td></tr><tr><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">StringBuilder</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">sb.length()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">sb.charAt(i)</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">append</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">deleteCharAt</code></td></tr><tr><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">List</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">list.size()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">list.get(i)</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">add</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">remove</code></td></tr><tr><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">Set</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">set.size()</code></td><td>无下标</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">add</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">remove</code></td></tr><tr><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">Map</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">map.size()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">map.get(key)</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">put</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">remove</code></td></tr><tr><td>栈 <code class=\"tok-inline\">Deque</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">stack.size()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">peek()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">push</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">pop</code></td></tr><tr><td>队列 <code class=\"tok-inline\">Queue</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">queue.size()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">peek()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">offer</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">poll</code></td></tr><tr><td>堆 <code class=\"tok-inline\">PriorityQueue</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">pq.size()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">peek()</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">offer</code></td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">poll</code></td></tr><tr><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td><td></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<h4 class=\"md-h md-h4\">0.4 容器怎么选</h4>\n<div class=\"md-table-wrap\"><table class=\"md-table\"><thead><tr><th>需求</th><th>优先选择</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>长度固定、按下标访问</td><td>数组</td></tr><tr><td>长度变化、按顺序收集答案</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">ArrayList</code></td></tr><tr><td>去重、判重、查是否出现过</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">HashSet</code></td></tr><tr><td>统计次数、值到下标、键值关联</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">HashMap</code></td></tr><tr><td>BFS、先进先出</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">Queue</code> + <code class=\"tok-inline\">ArrayDeque</code></td></tr><tr><td>栈、单调栈、双端操作</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">Deque</code> + <code class=\"tok-inline\">ArrayDeque</code></td></tr><tr><td>当前最小 / 最大、TopK</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">PriorityQueue</code></td></tr><tr><td>要按 key 自动有序</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">TreeMap</code> / <code class=\"tok-inline\">TreeSet</code></td></tr><tr><td>要保留插入顺序</td><td><code class=\"tok-inline\">LinkedHashMap</code> / <code class=\"tok-inline\">LinkedHashSet</code></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n<hr class=\"md-hr\">",
